<ArticleLayout
  title="How to Reduce Pollen and Dust Inside Your Home During Spring"
  seoTitle="Reduce Pollen and Dust Indoors This Spring"
  description="Trace how pollen and outdoor dust enter your home, then use practical entry, laundry, pet, vacuuming and ventilation routines before buying filtration."
